WEBVTT

00:00:27.523 --> 00:00:30.610
And did you know that this frenzy

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:33.863
was all because people
were desperate to watch

00:00:33.905 --> 00:00:37.742
a woman walk in circles on sawdust?

00:00:37.784 --> 00:00:39.160
(Laughter)

00:00:39.952 --> 00:00:41.829
The sport was pedestrianism --

00:00:42.663 --> 00:00:45.875
when watching people walk
was America's pastime.

00:00:45.875 --> 00:00:48.086
(Laughter)

00:00:48.086 --> 00:00:52.465
I won’t get too deep into the story
of our pedestrian, Ada Anderson,

00:00:52.507 --> 00:00:56.219
and the breathless “New York Times”
articles about her walk:

00:00:56.552 --> 00:01:03.226
2,700 quarter miles
in 2,700 consecutive quarter hours.